& [Architecture]
  + verifier module owns policy request payload envelope receipt strict forms digests raw proposal validation and Ed25519 verification
  + evidence module owns exact seven-file membership hashes strict retained equality and independent authorize/reject double replay
  + main CLI reads exactly three bounded paths and evidence CLI reads one bounded directory
  + integration tests alone own deterministic fixture signing material

& [FailureModel]
  + parse bounds identity raw proposal key fingerprint policy binding decision time signature fixture receipt nonclaim and effect faults are typed and returned before success
  + no repair fallback retry alternate key normalization partial receipt or broker call exists

& [ProofModel]
  + authorize and reject fixtures share exact policy and request but have distinct payload envelope receipt identities
  + fully redigested adversaries prove semantic refusal beyond checksum checks
  + static scans reject production signing ambient observation broker projection and effect surfaces

& [Result]
  + a valid signature may establish supplied-key correspondence only
  + policy governance current time fresh observation live authorization private permit and physical preparation remain false and separately governed
